<%= f.hidden_field :year,value: 2026 %><label>Filing status<%= f.select :filing_status,[['Single','single'],['Married filing jointly','joint'],['Married filing separately','separate'],['Head of household','head']] %></label><div class="lp-grid"><% [['profit','Expected annual business profit · blank uses classified book profit'],['other_ordinary_income','Other ordinary income, including wages'],['social_security_wages','Owner wages subject to Social Security'],['medicare_wages','Owner Medicare wages'],['spouse_medicare_wages','Spouse Medicare wages · joint only'],['agi_adjustments','Other AGI adjustments'],['deductions','Reviewed deductions, including any QBI · blank uses base standard deduction'],['nonrefundable_credits','Nonrefundable credits'],['refundable_credits','Refundable credits'],['other_taxes','Other reviewed taxes'],['withholding','Expected annual tax withholding'],['prior_tax','Prior-year tax'],['prior_agi','Prior-year AGI']].each do |key,label| %><label><%= label %> (USD)<%= f.number_field key,step: '0.01' %></label><% end %></div><label class="lp-check"><%= f.check_box :prior_full_year %> Prior-year return covered a full 12-month tax year</label>

<details><summary>Payments already made for this tax year</summary><p>Manual payment records affect the worksheet. They do not establish an IRS acknowledgment or trigger a payment.</p><% 4.times do |index| %><div class="lp-grid"><label>Payment date<%= date_field_tag "tax[payments][#{index}][date]" %></label><label>Amount (USD)<%= number_field_tag "tax[payments][#{index}][amount]",nil,min: 0,step: '0.01' %></label></div><% end %></details>
